    "narrative": "The Austin Waves look to capitalize on high-upside matchups today, led by **Gunnar Henderson**, who registers our highest score at 83.29. Facing V\u00e1squez (xERA 4.89), **Gunnar Henderson** benefits from a massive 19% skill boost and a 16% park factor advantage, making him a prime candidate for power production. **Jackson Merrill** follows closely (75.10) against the high-xERA Gibson; both **Gunnar Henderson** and **Jackson Merrill** are elevated by their favorable placement in the two-hole and advantageous platoon splits against right-handed pitching. **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (72.20) and **Kyle Tucker** (65.91) remain essential starts, with **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** providing significant efficiency in the two-hole, while **Kyle Tucker** maintains a high floor despite facing a tougher opponent in Burke.\n\nThe bench decision-making process was headlined by **Nolan Schanuel**, who narrowly missed the cut with a 47.45 score. While **Nolan Schanuel** projected as a viable utility option, his score was suppressed by the high skill level of Griffin Jax (xERA 3.52) and the uncertainty of a pending lineup. Ultimately, the optimizer prioritized the higher ceiling of **Curtis Mead** (57.87) in the UTIL slot, as **Curtis Mead** benefits from a favorable platoon advantage against Castillo. We are monitoring **Jacob Wilson** and **Wade Meckler** closely; both are currently penciled in based on assumed lineup positions, and any shifts in their batting order could necessitate a pivot to our bench depth. \n\nWhile **Nasim Nunez** (50.27) and **Sam Antonacci** (45.30) remain in the lineup to chase steals, their scores are dampened by the elite pitch-suppression metrics of Castillo and Yamamoto, respectively. We are tempering expectations for **Josh Jung** (54.24), who faces a sub-4.00 xERA arm in Suarez, and **Liam Hicks** (56.10), who remains a marginal start despite a positive lead-off bump. With **Luis Robert Jr.** remaining sidelined on the IL, we are leaning heavily on the volume of our current starters to navigate these matchups while keeping a close eye on the weather and official lineup cards as they surface throughout the afternoon.",
